  operator's request path, and the test results are recorded.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P0)** — All serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters\n  using validated crypto modules (no non-validated crypto in the request path).\n  This epic delivers the Platform Operator portion.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":50259,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-879b2d36a972f8a6","agent_id":"a832036afe753050e","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"7202953d-38f5-4346-8912-1ec4540288ed","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:09:07.444Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
