cord the test results.\n50\t- Hand off the module inventory and the verification test results as inputs to the\n51\t  compliance evidence package.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A module inventory exists for the Platform Operator image, listing linked\n56\t  cryptographic modules and flagging each non-validated usage in the request path.\n57\t- An image scan of the remediated image shows no non-validated cryptographic\n58\t  module linked in the request path.\n59\t- The remediated image builds successfully through the existing build pipeline.\n60\t- Functional verification on a FIPS-enabled OpenShift cluster passes for the\n61\t  operator's request path, and the test results are recorded.\n62\t\n63\t## HLR Traceability\n64\t\n65\t- **HLR-1 (P0)** — All serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters\n66\t  using validated crypto modules (no non-validated crypto in the request path).\n67\t  This epic delivers the Platform Operator portion.\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa6422f5086bb052","agent_id":"a090fa2fed4ccaea4","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"d193b3f7-214c-4ce9-8c0a-810bdfca61db","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:11:35.406Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8dc7a216a0e4fe04","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
