isted as KServe dependencies\nin the architecture context) would require additional epics if intended in\nscope. The ambiguity is disclosed, not silently dropped; the correction is to\nconfirm scope with the strategy owner before scheduling, not to change the\ndecomposition.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35822,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa6422f5086bb052","agent_id":"a090fa2fed4ccaea4","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"835913f5-65ab-4768-9765-5f1cf8930f93","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:14:47.028Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
