T-9013-E005, whose acceptance criteria are written at the\n146\t  engineering-controlled endpoint (assembly and confirmed submission), per the\n147\t  externally-controlled-precondition rule.\n148\t\n149\t## Tiered Delivery\n150\t\n151\tNot applicable. The external accredited laboratory gates the *certification\n152\toutcome*, which is outside the HLR scope — HLR-2's endpoint is assembly and\n153\tsubmission of the evidence package. All in-strategy work (HLR-1 through HLR-4) is\n154\tdeliverable without the lab's response, so there is no Tier 1 / Tier 2 split and\n155\tno upstream epic with uncertain timing gating downstream engineering work.\n156\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-895683de6985d69b","agent_id":"a0d70266d0e7a7c96","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"7c0f6f87-7207-4ca9-a61d-8b8c2eee9195","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:15:50.938Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5a6b3fa47e5d8a6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
