{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-945d4e73abe3780f","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E003\n3\ttitle: FIPS regression gating check for KServe serving-stack builds\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 1\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 0\n15\t  external_dependency: 0\n16\t  human_process_gates: 0\n17\t  repo_access: 1\n18\t  architecture_claims: 1\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 4\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# FIPS regression gating check for KServe serving-stack builds\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic adds a gating CI check to the KServe serving-stack build pipeline that\n34\tfails any build whose image reintroduces non-validated crypto usage in the request\n35\tpath, so FIPS regressions are caught before shipping rather than rediscovered at\n36\tthe next audit.\n37\t\n38\t## Scope\n39\t\n40\t- Implement a detection check that scans built serving-stack images for\n41\t  non-validated cryptographic module usage in the request path, using the same\n42\t  validated-module criteria as the remediation audit.\n43\t- Wire the check into the KServe serving-stack build pipeline as a gating step\n44\t  (a failed check blocks the build from shipping; it is not advisory).\n45\t- Validate the check with a negative test: a deliberately non-compliant build\n46\t  fails, and a compliant (post-remediation) build passes.\n47\t\n48\t## Acceptance Criteria\n49\t\n50\t- The gating check runs on every KServe serving-stack build in the pipeline.\n51\t- A build whose image reintroduces non-validated crypto usage in the request path\n52\t  fails the check, demonstrated with a deliberately non-compliant test build.\n53\t- The check is gating: a failed check blocks the build from shipping.\n54\t- A build whose image contains only validated crypto in the request path passes\n55\t  the check.\n56\t\n57\t## HLR Traceability\n58\t\n59\t- **HLR-3 (P1)** — CI enforces FIPS regressions: a gating check fails any\n60\t  serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage. This epic\n61\t  delivers the KServe-builds portion.\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-895683de6985d69b","agent_id":"a0d70266d0e7a7c96","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"fa336937-5393-4b00-bf31-1b26a0084f18","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:15:51.748Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-945d4e73abe3780f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
