t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- The evidence package includes a module inventory covering every serving-stack\n56\t  image in scope.\n57\t- The evidence package includes the signed build attestations produced by the\n58\t  serving-stack build pipelines for the remediated images.\n59\t- The evidence package includes the FIPS verification test results from the\n60\t  remediated images.\n61\t- The evidence package is submitted through the security review board to the\n62\t  external certification lab, and the submission is confirmed.\n63\t\n64\t## Risks / Notes\n65\t\n66\t- Certification lab turnaround is historically six to nine months and the\n67\t  review-board cadence is externally controlled; neither can be compressed by\n68\t  engineering effort. These are schedule risks on this epic, not acceptance\n69\t  conditions — the acceptance criteria above are written at the\n70\t  engineering-controlled endpoint (assembly and confirmed submission).\n71\t- Security review board sign-off at the defined milestones is a mandatory human\n72\t  process gate embedded in the submission route.\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- **HLR-2 (P0)** — A compliance evidence package (module inventory, build\n77\t  attestations, test results) is assembled and submitted through the security\n78\t  review board to the external certification lab. This epic delivers it in full.\n79\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8b83a72c36e5717","agent_id":"ac5781b82d2d11816","session_id":"507c58fb-94b1-4432-a69d-7f745e4ce707","uuid":"59921398-7e7b-4296-b14d-52cd4af6368c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:23:34.910Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a7b74bdef8b4f922","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 again"}
